---
const phone = "(786) 531-7439";
const email = "brandonm@gbbegroup.com";
---

<head>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
</head>

<div class="page">
  <main class="flyer">
    <section class="hero">
      <a class="lang-btn" href="/pricing"> See in English </a>

      <p class="eyebrow">Karate - Kickboxing - MMA - Edades 3 a Adulto</p>

      <h1>
        ENTRENAMIENTO<br />
        PRIVADO DE<br />
        <span class="red">ARTES MARCIALES</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="description">
        Entrenamiento personalizado 1-a-1 sin compromiso a largo plazo. Las
        sesiones privadas est&aacute;n disponibles en un parque local o
        directamente en su hogar.
      </p>

      <div class="highlight">
        <div class="highlight-price">$85-$165</div>

        <div>
          <div class="highlight-title">Opciones Flexibles de Sesiones</div>

          <div class="highlight-small">Ahorre cuando reserve 4 sesiones</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <h2>Lo Que Recibe</h2>

        <div class="benefit">
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <span>Entrenamiento personalizado 1-a-1</span>
        </div>

        <div class="benefit">
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <span>Planes de lecciones estructurados</span>
        </div>

        <div class="benefit">
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <span
            >Seguimiento de progreso despu&eacute;s de cada sesi&oacute;n</span
          >
        </div>

        <div class="benefit">
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <span>Enfoque en confianza y disciplina</span>
        </div>

        <div class="benefit">
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <span>Entrenamiento para principiantes y avanzados</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2>Sin Compromiso a Largo Plazo</h2>

        <div class="benefit">
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <span>Entrene a su propio ritmo</span>
        </div>

        <div class="benefit">
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <span>Reserve sesiones individuales</span>
        </div>

        <div class="benefit">
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <span>Ahorre con paquetes de 4 sesiones</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pricing">
      <h2>Precios</h2>

      <div class="pricing-grid">
        <div class="price-card">
          <h3>Sesiones Individuales</h3>

          <p class="sub">En Parque Local</p>
          <p>30 min - $85</p>
          <p>45 min - $110</p>
          <p>60 min - $135</p>

          <p class="sub">En Casa</p>
          <p>45 min - $125</p>
          <p>60 min - $165</p>
        </div>

        <div class="price-card featured">
          <h3>Precios Promedio</h3>

          <p class="big-price">$85-$165</p>

          <p class="muted">Opciones flexibles de sesiones disponibles</p>

          <p class="muted">Ahorre con paquetes</p>
        </div>

        <div class="price-card">
          <h3>Paquetes de 4 Sesiones</h3>

          <p class="sub">En Parque Local</p>
          <p>4 x 30 min - $300</p>
          <p>4 x 45 min - $395</p>
          <p>4 x 60 min - $445</p>

          <p class="sub">En Casa</p>
          <p>4 x 45 min - $445</p>
          <p>4 x 60 min - $535</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta">
      <div>
        <h3>RESERVE SU PRIMERA SESI&Oacute;N HOY</h3>

        <p>
          Comience con una sesi&oacute;n privada y elija la opci&oacute;n que
          mejor se adapte a su horario, metas y ubicaci&oacute;n.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="contact">
        <div class="contact-label">Contacto</div>

        <div class="contact-name">Brandon Mederos</div>

        <a href="tel:17865317439">{phone}</a>

        <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</div>

<style>
  :global(html),
  :global(body) {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    width: 100%;
    background: #050505;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  :global(body) {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
  }

  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .lang-btn {
    position: absolute;
    top: 22px;
    right: 22px;

    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;

    padding: 10px 14px;

    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);

    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);

    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
    text-decoration: none;

    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;

    transition:
      background 0.2s ease,
      border-color 0.2s ease,
      color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .lang-btn:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.35);
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  .page {
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    background: #050505;
  }

  .flyer {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #050505;
  }

  .hero {
    padding: 56px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(
        circle at top right,
        rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.28),
        transparent 35%
      ),
      radial-gradient(
        circle at bottom left,
        rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.16),
        transparent 35%
      );
  }

  .eyebrow {
    color: #f87171;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(48px, 8vw, 82px);
    line-height: 0.9;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    font-weight: 950;
    margin: 0 0 26px;
  }

  .red {
    color: #ef4444;
  }

  .description {
    color: #d4d4d8;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    max-width: 650px;
  }

  .highlight {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 18px;
    background: #dc2626;
    padding: 18px 24px;
    border-radius: 22px;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.35);
  }

  .highlight-price {
    font-size: 42px;
    font-weight: 950;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .highlight-title {
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 900;
  }

  .highlight-small {
    color: #fee2e2;
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 18px;
    padding: 34px 56px;
  }

  .card,
  .price-card {
    background: rgba(24, 24, 27, 0.86);
    border: 1px solid #3f3f46;
    border-radius: 28px;
    padding: 28px;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
  }

  .card h2,
  .pricing h2,
  .price-card h3 {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    font-weight: 950;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .card h2 {
    font-size: 30px;
  }

  .benefit {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    background: rgba(39, 39, 42, 0.82);
    border: 1px solid #3f3f46;
    padding: 15px;
    border-radius: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    color: #e4e4e7;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .dot {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    min-width: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #ef4444;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }

  .pricing {
    padding: 10px 56px 40px;
  }

  .pricing h2 {
    color: #ef4444;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 42px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .pricing-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.9fr 1fr;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .price-card {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .price-card h3 {
    font-size: 25px;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .price-card p {
    color: #d4d4d8;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    margin: 8px 0;
  }

  .sub {
    color: #ffffff !important;
    font-weight: 900;
    margin-top: 20px !important;
  }

  .featured {
    background: #dc2626;
    border-color: #ef4444;
  }

  .featured p,
  .featured h3 {
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .big-price {
    font-size: 44px !important;
    font-weight: 950;
    line-height: 1 !important;
    margin: 20px 0 !important;
  }

  .muted {
    color: #fee2e2 !important;
    font-size: 15px !important;
  }

  .cta {
    background: #dc2626;
    padding: 34px 56px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 28px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .cta h3 {
    font-size: 31px;
    font-weight: 950;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .cta p {
    color: #fee2e2;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .contact {
    background: #ffffff;
    color: #050505;
    border-radius: 22px;
    padding: 24px 28px;
    min-width: 330px;
    max-width: 360px;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28);
  }

  .contact-label {
    color: #71717a;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.24em;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .contact-name {
    font-size: 25px;
    font-weight: 950;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .contact a {
    display: block;
    color: #dc2626;
    font-weight: 900;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-top: 6px;
    word-break: break-word;
  }

  @media (max-width: 950px) {
    .flyer {
      max-width: none;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 32px 22px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(52px, 15vw, 76px);
      line-height: 0.87;
    }

    .description {
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .highlight {
      width: 100%;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .highlight-price {
      font-size: 34px;
    }

    .cards,
    .pricing {
      padding: 24px 22px;
    }

    .cards,
    .pricing-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .card,
    .price-card {
      padding: 24px;
      border-radius: 26px;
    }

    .card h2 {
      font-size: 31px;
    }

    .benefit {
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .pricing h2 {
      font-size: 38px;
    }

    .price-card h3 {
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    .price-card p {
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .featured {
      order: -1;
    }

    .big-price {
      font-size: 48px !important;
    }

    .cta {
      padding: 32px 22px;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    .contact {
      width: 100%;
      min-width: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
